! HVAC system type of every zone from the xlsx (Zone and HVAC System Summary, HVAC System Type Dictionary): 3 PSZ-AC (packaged rooftop air conditioner with a gas furnace) for the office and the fine storage, 9 heating and ventilation (gas-fired warm air furnace, no cooling) for the bulk storage. The xlsx names the HVAC system of each zone (raw_data column I). All equipment data are EnergyPlus defaults.
