    ,                             !- Constant Heating Setpoint
    Fine Storage Cooling Setpoint Schedule;!- Cooling Setpoint Schedule Name  Source: xlsx Schedule Summary 'Cooling Set Point', rows 599/600/601 (Mon - Fri/Sat/Sun) (Bulk Storage; the xlsx gives no cooling set point for it, the one of the Fine Storage is written because the template needs one and the zone has no cooling).

